WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.334
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.567
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:04.567
[ Cheering and applause ]
Thank you for watching.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.834
Thank you for being here.

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:08.100
Well, guys,
here's some good news --

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.467
after being closed last year
because of the pandemic,

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:12.334
it was just announced
that Times Square

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:15.367
will be open on New Year's Eve
for the fully vaccinated.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:18.367
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:23.200
Yep, only in New York City
could thousands of people

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.767
peeing and puking
in Times Square

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:26.501
be seen
as "getting back to normal,"

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:27.501
you know what I'm saying?

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:28.701
[ Cheering and applause ]
Yeah!

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:30.601
We're back to --

00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:32.300
[ Laughter ]
-[ Retches ]

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.701
-That's right, everyone there
must be fully vaccinated.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.968
Officials say the only thing
you should go home with is

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:38.133
hypothermia.

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:39.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:40.467
Well, this is
a pretty crazy story --

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:42.834
apparently,
Russia just fired a missile

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:44.834
that blew up one
of their old satellites

00:00:44.834 --> 00:00:47.934
and it created thousands
of pieces of debris in space.

00:00:47.934 --> 00:00:49.000
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.133
Vladimir Putin was like --

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.734
[ As Putin ]
Sorry, it was gender reveal

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:53.801
[ Laughter and applause ]
gone way too far.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:56.868
Hey --

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:59.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.467
Follow me on TikTok.

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.834
I have more videos like that.

00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:04.968
I just goof off, have fun,
stuff like that.

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:06.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.601
Some news
from the White House --

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:09.367
last night,
President Biden finally had

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:12.334
his virtual summit
with Chinese President Xi.

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:14.868
It lasted more
than three hours.

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:17.000
Yeah, for three hours,
they debated a bunch of issues

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.934
without reaching any kind
of agreement.

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:21.067
In other words, they celebrated
Thanksgiving earlier.

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:22.834
There you go.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:25.100
That's right.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.801
Just let's agree to disagree.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:31.267
Today, President Biden visited
a structurally deficient bridge

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.868
in New Hampshire, to sell
his infrastructure plan...

00:01:33.868 --> 00:01:35.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.567
...and he had to do
a bit of walking,

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:40.601
a bit of walking to get
to the podium. Watch this.

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.367
-The president
of the United States,

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.634
Joseph R. Biden Jr.

00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:49.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:50.834
Dude, look at this.

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:53.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.367
Dude, look.

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:56.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:57.234
Dude, they're --

00:01:57.234 --> 00:01:59.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:00.467
What the...?

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:03.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.334 --> 00:02:08.734
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:11.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:12.133
-Holy...

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.467
-Thank you.

00:02:15.467 --> 00:02:20.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.167
We actually played that
at double speed.

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:24.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:27.400
Then, Biden was like, "Oh,
hang on, I forgot my speech."

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:30.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:34.367
You want to start the Amer--

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:35.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:37.300
Ladies and gentleman,
the president --

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:40.000
[ Laughter ]
He's like, "You got to be
kidding me, man."

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.234
By the time he got to the mic,

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:42.934
half the bridge
had already been demolished.

00:02:42.934 --> 00:02:45.067
[ Laughter ]
-Wow!

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:46.834
Meanwhile,
I saw that House Democrats

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:50.000
are trying to pass a nearly
$2 trillion spending package.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.968
But some people are worried
that they won't be able

00:02:51.968 --> 00:02:54.667
to unite in time
to pass it before the holidays.

00:02:54.667 --> 00:02:56.367
A few Democrats have even
released statements

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:57.634
about the whole thing.

00:02:57.634 --> 00:02:59.734
Check this out.
Congressman David Price said...

00:03:04.834 --> 00:03:07.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:09.601
Next up,
Congressman Josh Harder said...

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:16.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.601 --> 00:03:18.767
Congresswoman Susan Wild said...

00:03:23.067 --> 00:03:26.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:28.133
[ Cheering ]

00:03:30.434 --> 00:03:31.934
There's more.
-More?

00:03:31.934 --> 00:03:33.767
There's more people.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.767 --> 00:03:35.968
Congresswoman Karen Bass said...

00:03:41.367 --> 00:03:42.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.501 --> 00:03:44.100
And Congressman
Jared Huffman said...

00:03:49.234 --> 00:03:52.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.934
[ Applause ]

00:03:53.934 --> 00:03:56.367
And Congresswoman
Lisa Blunt Rochester --

00:03:56.367 --> 00:03:59.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.133 --> 00:04:00.968
-Lisa Blunt Rochester?
Okay.

00:04:01.033 --> 00:04:04.067
-Lisa Blunt Rochester,
she was like...

00:04:09.601 --> 00:04:12.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:15.133 --> 00:04:16.601
There's more people.
-Really?

00:04:16.601 --> 00:04:18.534
-Yeah, Congressman Al Green
said...

00:04:23.133 --> 00:04:25.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.868 --> 00:04:30.968
And, finally, Congressman
Charles Albert "Dutch"
Ruppersberger III said...

00:04:32.033 --> 00:04:34.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:34.133 --> 00:04:37.100
[ Rimshot ]

00:04:39.534 --> 00:04:42.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:47.567
Well, get this -- yesterday,
the Environmental Protection
Agency announced

00:04:47.567 --> 00:04:51.667
the country's first national
recycling strategy, yeah.

00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:52.934
Then, today, they announced

00:04:52.934 --> 00:04:55.834
the country's first
national recycling strategy.

00:04:55.834 --> 00:04:58.167
[ Scattered laughter
and applause ]

00:05:00.167 --> 00:05:01.501
-[ Laughing ] What?

00:05:06.434 --> 00:05:09.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.567 --> 00:05:14.767
Today, they announced
the country's first

00:05:14.767 --> 00:05:16.934
national recycling strategy.

00:05:16.934 --> 00:05:18.901
Yep, the strategy's
just one sentence --

00:05:18.901 --> 00:05:20.934
"Stop forgetting that you have
tote bags in your trunk."

00:05:20.934 --> 00:05:23.334
That's it.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.334 --> 00:05:25.400
Ah, in my -- yeah.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.501
It counts, right?
"No, it doesn't."

00:05:27.501 --> 00:05:30.033
Finally, General Motors just
announced that the chip shortage

00:05:30.033 --> 00:05:32.133
has gotten so bad,
some of its new cars

00:05:32.133 --> 00:05:33.834
won't have heated seats.

00:05:33.834 --> 00:05:35.701
[ Audience oohs ]

00:05:35.701 --> 00:05:37.901
At the same time, Hyundai
is reminding people that,

00:05:37.901 --> 00:05:40.200
if their seats are warm,
it's because the engine is

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.300
on fire.
[ Laughter and applause ]

